{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S12-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.1\", \"B1.2\", \"B1.3\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"主题轰然回归、沉重落步，让继续生活的念头从仍带不安的愿望变成明确的向前力量；这股力量也可以向外展开为公开、近乎集体的昂扬。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-2\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B2.1\", \"B2.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"往后的方向逐渐清楚，并不代表亲近就能留住：他仍会犹疑、疲惫、想念，也不必假装没有受伤，而是在这些痕迹中选择站稳。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-2\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B3.1\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"249–253间短暂的变色，像亲近难留带来的一下失衡或难过；它只让脚步偏斜片刻，并没有中断继续生活的方向。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"why\": \"主题以雷鸣般的声势回归、步伐沉实向前，将前段带着不安继续生活的念头推进为更清楚、更有力量的行动方向；外放的昂扬也可以成为这种方向感的表现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"],\n      \"why\": \"亲近难以留住带来的难过与想念，解释了为什么主动选择站稳并不等于否认伤痕，也解释了音乐短暂失衡后仍继续向前的变化。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": []\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "606acad1-0dad-4fd7-b93d-483d8d94e344", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T084610984902Z", "elapsed_seconds": 247.906, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T08:50:18.894271+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5b0aba309259d5f02375a420afdf1b7da37800b54ac623631fb6ad120007875d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c13